# Manual API tests for the IntelliJ HTTP Client
# start the app first, then hit the green play button next to a request

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### API info
GET http://localhost:8080/api/info

### All tracked objects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects

### Tracked object by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/2

### Only hazardous objects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/hazardous

### Number of tracked objects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tracked-objects/count
